> Read the tip height from two angles

The two unit links give tip height minuscos(theta1) minuscos(theta1+theta2). Height greater than1 is the swing-up goal. The derivative and RK4 implementation in the native class advance the coupled angles and velocities.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/acrobot_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
